<title>GERMANY: Hoechst - no plans to drop Clariant.</title>
<headline>Hoechst - no plans to drop Clariant.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemicals and drugs group Hoechst AG said on Wednesday it did not plan to pull out of Swiss chemicals group Clariant AG in the short or medium term.</p>
<p>&quot;Whatever happens in 10 years is not up for discussion,&quot; Hoechst chief executive Juergen Dormann added at a news conference.</p>
<p>Dormann also told reporters that Hoechst had no immediate plans to pull out of its industrial gas production unit, Messer Griesheim.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
